{"id":"n56361-2-9","stage":1,"title":"바깥쪽 · 外侧","scene":"医疗与健康","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56361-2-9-1","ko":"어디가 아파서 오셨나요?","zh":"请问您哪里不舒服？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디가","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디가","audio":"/audio/6d28cfb014a6b7e4f086.mp3"}},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"不舒服、疼","explanation":"어디가 아파서 오셨나요? 在就诊时询问身体哪里疼痛或不舒服。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파서","audio":"/audio/1d188c109f3d5cabce14.mp3"}},{"text":"오셨나요?","meaning":"前来就诊","explanation":"오셨나요? 问对方因哪里不舒服而来到这里，语境是就医。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오셨나요","audio":"/audio/3b5d2b26e74be16c3e76.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7e74ed314ec53365f28.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56361-2-9-2","ko":"무릎 바깥쪽에 통증이 있어서 왔어요.","zh":"我的膝盖外侧疼，所以来就诊了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무릎","meaning":"膝盖","explanation":"무릎：膝盖。","readings":[{"term":"무릎","audio":"/audio/a088ec9c747fb05fd92c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":